With archive.regions: all, a region that lacks Firehose delivery to Iceberg or the Glue
table optimizers fails at its entry in regions, and the hint lists the regions that can
archive.
-- dynaflux.yaml --
store: analytics
regions: [us-east-1, mx-central-1, eu-west-1, us-west-1]
-- dynaflux/page_views.sql --
CREATE STREAM page_views (user_id String)
PRIMARY KEY (user_id);
-- want --
dynaflux.yaml:2:22: error DF6505
dynaflux.yaml:2:47: error DF6505
-- want-text --
dynaflux.yaml:2:22: error DF6505: archive.regions is all, so mx-central-1 archives too, but it has no Firehose delivery to Apache Iceberg Tables and no AWS Glue table optimizers
  hint: list the regions to archive in, such as archive.regions: [us-east-1, eu-west-1]
dynaflux.yaml:2:47: error DF6505: archive.regions is all, so us-west-1 archives too, but it has no AWS Glue table optimizers
  hint: list the regions to archive in, such as archive.regions: [us-east-1, eu-west-1]
